### 1. Valid order → expect 201
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "6ac7680ebc36899d1167e03e",
  "name": "Matti Meikäläinen",
  "email": "matti@example.com",
  "quantity": 2
}

### 2. Event doesn't exist → expect 404
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "64b7f0000000000000000000",
  "name": "Liisa Virtanen",
  "email": "liisa@example.com",
  "quantity": 1
}

### 3. Missing email → expect an error
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "6ac7680ebc36899d1167e03e",
  "name": "No Email",
  "quantity": 1
}